  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d1a5e53a-a7ca-48ae-bb30-9c5a05c65374-12-7-20225.png\" style=\"width: 234px; height: 185px;\" /></p><p>If the initial pressure of a gas is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math>, the mass of the gas adsorbed per gram of the adsorbent is____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation for&nbsp;Freundlich&#39;s adsorption isotherm is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>KP</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>logK</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mi>logP</mi></math></p><p>Intercept <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>logK</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>602</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Slope <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>g</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;the mass of the gas adsorbed per gram of the adsorbent is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p>",
